{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Hellfire Poncho",
    "steam_appid": 3017150,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017150/extras/f8e442b882362dd91e71eea2af134bcb.avif?t=1749071802\" data-has-big width=800 height=542 /></span>The <strong>definitive</strong> western poncho roguelite experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a trip through hell as Poncho Rodriguez, the most ruthless outlaw from the Wild West.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go on a rampage while enjoying the dynamic electro-western music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet creatures that will try to help or (and) kill you and reclaim what you were stolen...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your best card deck which you can bet on the saloon in a surreal <strong>dice poker game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017150/extras/4ece418b42411e55fd6964a1edd0d27d.avif?t=1749071802\" data-has-big width=800 height=197 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017150/extras/d69ebb4133ac7607aa90d5067bb9d632.poster.avif?t=1749071802\" width=616 height=215 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017150/extras/d69ebb4133ac7607aa90d5067bb9d632.webm?t=1749071802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades come in the shape of cards. Choose thoughtfully and prepare yourself for the next levels.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon cards: Reveal unique weapons with different play styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade cards: Upgrade your stats and modify your weapons to the limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dice: Gather different special dice to increase your chances in the poker game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectibles: Find these rare collectibles to learn about Poncho's story...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017150/extras/eb65d95bc58532a8d2e7e5050c214278.avif?t=1749071802\" data-has-big width=800 height=197 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017150/extras/a4d27a9e33a0f74f1098bd7db5f1bb8b.poster.avif?t=1749071802\" width=616 height=215 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017150/extras/a4d27a9e33a0f74f1098bd7db5f1bb8b.webm?t=1749071802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Try your luck on a dice game against the fellows you find in the saloon, make your build even stronger, or start from zero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017150/extras/219ef915f03d27c89579b1eede5a3669.avif?t=1749071802\" data-has-big width=800 height=197 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017150/extras/25e538722f85cefde82a0f4ff4fb577f.poster.avif?t=1749071802\" width=616 height=215 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017150/extras/25e538722f85cefde82a0f4ff4fb577f.webm?t=1749071802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Apply modifications to your weapons, go for a hell-destructive build covering the whole level in bullets, or you may prefer to go slowly with your sniper shooting from afar...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the cards you liked for the next run or use them to get better ones at the saloon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your strategy through runs and don't be afraid to start again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017150/extras/3ddc5c15bede72cf2ca183feb2448d95.avif?t=1749071802\" data-has-big width=800 height=197 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017150/extras/e3b8d4e541d41dd40d438ea13cee3fec.avif?t=1749071802\" data-has-big width=800 height=279 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017150/extras/10c412537b50bdd1aea570044cb498ab.avif?t=1749071802\" width=616 height=244 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017150/extras/f8e442b882362dd91e71eea2af134bcb.avif?t=1749071802\" data-has-big width=800 height=542 /></span>The <strong>definitive</strong> western poncho roguelite experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a trip through hell as Poncho Rodriguez, the most ruthless outlaw from the Wild West.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go on a rampage while enjoying the dynamic electro-western music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet creatures that will try to help or (and) kill you and reclaim what you were stolen...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your best card deck which you can bet on the saloon in a surreal <strong>dice poker game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017150/extras/4ece418b42411e55fd6964a1edd0d27d.avif?t=1749071802\" data-has-big width=800 height=197 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017150/extras/d69ebb4133ac7607aa90d5067bb9d632.poster.avif?t=1749071802\" width=616 height=215 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017150/extras/d69ebb4133ac7607aa90d5067bb9d632.webm?t=1749071802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades come in the shape of cards. Choose thoughtfully and prepare yourself for the next levels.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon cards: Reveal unique weapons with different play styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade cards: Upgrade your stats and modify your weapons to the limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dice: Gather different special dice to increase your chances in the poker game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectibles: Find these rare collectibles to learn about Poncho's story...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017150/extras/eb65d95bc58532a8d2e7e5050c214278.avif?t=1749071802\" data-has-big width=800 height=197 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017150/extras/a4d27a9e33a0f74f1098bd7db5f1bb8b.poster.avif?t=1749071802\" width=616 height=215 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017150/extras/a4d27a9e33a0f74f1098bd7db5f1bb8b.webm?t=1749071802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Try your luck on a dice game against the fellows you find in the saloon, make your build even stronger, or start from zero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017150/extras/219ef915f03d27c89579b1eede5a3669.avif?t=1749071802\" data-has-big width=800 height=197 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017150/extras/25e538722f85cefde82a0f4ff4fb577f.poster.avif?t=1749071802\" width=616 height=215 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017150/extras/25e538722f85cefde82a0f4ff4fb577f.webm?t=1749071802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Apply modifications to your weapons, go for a hell-destructive build covering the whole level in bullets, or you may prefer to go slowly with your sniper shooting from afar...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the cards you liked for the next run or use them to get better ones at the saloon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your strategy through runs and don't be afraid to start again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017150/extras/3ddc5c15bede72cf2ca183feb2448d95.avif?t=1749071802\" data-has-big width=800 height=197 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017150/extras/e3b8d4e541d41dd40d438ea13cee3fec.avif?t=1749071802\" data-has-big width=800 height=279 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017150/extras/10c412537b50bdd1aea570044cb498ab.avif?t=1749071802\" width=616 height=244 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Hellfire Poncho is a western rogue-lite isometric shooter. Shoot little demons with your upgraded weapons, die, and try again stronger. Bet your upgrades against the creatures you meet in the saloon, and develop your best build. Don't push your luck...",
